{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>警務處今日（23日）為2005年執勤期間遇襲遭割頸癱瘓，上月離世的高級警員朱振國舉行警隊最高榮譽喪禮。喪禮今早於紅磡世界殯儀館舉行，行政長官李家超、保安局局長鄧炳強、政務司司長陳國基、公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵、警務處處長周一鳴、前警務處處長李明逵，以及立法會主席李慧琼、行政會議召集人葉劉淑儀、海關關長陳子達等多名高層官員親臨致哀，聯同社會各界人士向朱振國作最後致敬，警隊亦列隊送別，場面莊嚴肅穆。  </p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-06-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-07-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-11-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>蓋上香港特區區旗的靈柩離開殯儀館後，送殯行列隨即前往朱振國生前駐守的長沙灣分區警署進行道別儀式，其後駛往粉嶺和合石墳場浩園。下午約12時半，由警隊護送組開路的靈車抵達浩園。現場氣氛莊嚴哀傷，警務處處長周一鳴聯同大批警隊同袍早已在場列隊，神情哀痛地迎候靈柩。  </p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-13-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-16-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>安葬儀式隨後以道教及中式步操禮儀舉行。在警察樂隊奏起的哀樂聲中，靈柩由同袍扶靈步入墓地。在場官員及警隊人員默哀兩分鐘，警察儀仗隊隨後作最後致敬。儀式期間，警隊代表將特區區旗及朱振國生前佩戴的警帽妥善摺疊，交予其遺孀及家屬。  </p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-21-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-1-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-23-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-31-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-36-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-5-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-38-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-39-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-40-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-41-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023_PoliceFuneral-43-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>儀式尾聲，警務處處長周一鳴多度走近朱振國親屬表達慰問，禮儀師其後為朱振國家屬即場除下麻服。朱振國因公受創並一直臥床，腦癱成為植物人的21年來，全賴家屬不離不棄悉心守護。隨着安葬儀式圓滿結束，獲頒授金英勇勳章的高級警員朱振國，在同袍與親友的敬意中，正式「落更」，長眠浩園。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T21:04:24.019212+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":579,"images":16,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:21:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.354022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:58:18.083669+00:00","content_hash":"7a6c4822c37a8cf11d934e958b704434b4ecd3eb109b5bf52d40583ccceef9d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}